            "review_title": "Review at First Contact Bar & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Alison01924\nLeeds, United Kingdom69 contributions\n0\nNice little coffee bar, friendly staff\nNov 2015 • Family\nMy sister and I came here to shelter from the rain on 2nd November 2015. It is clearly intended for young hip people but we felt very comfortable and the staff were very friendly. People came in for breakfast as late as midday so it is very flexible. We did not eat but drank lovely, fresh watermelon shakes and we're pleased that the rain had introduced us to this really nice place. Free WiFi too.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 5, 2015",
